/-!
# TOP18: the current best headline for the D87 Theorem 1.8 (wiring only)

Sheffield, arXiv:1012.4797, Theorem 1.8 (p. 26), in the D87 form `R18.theorem1_8PaperMO`
(RT6MODefs.lean). Starting point: `theorem1_8PaperMO_of_frontier13` (RT6bHead.lean), with every
hypothesis that is already proved discharged:

* G1: side limit along the selected map (`g1Z4SideLimSelStmt_holds`), node B0 and the transport
  identity (`g1SideBdryRegStmt_holds`, `g1SideTransportIdStmt_holds`, WBAM1.lean) remove `hZ4`,
  `hWBAM`; A2 from Z2 goodness (`g1RerootFactorStmt_of_good`); Z2 goodness from the area leaf
  (`g1Z2SideGoodStmt_of_area`); the shifted regularity in its D89 form
  (`g1SideShiftRegAStmt_of_pushCont`, `g1SideConstInvStmt_of_regA`, `g3JointConstInvStmt_of_regA`);
  A1b from its convergence clause (`g1ZA1bSideExactArcStmt_of_tendsto`); the Palm constant
  (`g1PalmConstStmt_of_nodes`, as in `g1PalmConstStmt_of_leaves` but without `hZ4`, `hWBAM`).
* G3: `g3PaperStmt_of_nodes` rewired as in `g3PaperStmt_of_leaves` without `hZ4`, `hWBAM`, `hSSR`;
  step 5T from its leaves (`g3WedgeFreeTransferStmt_of_leaves`) with (G-b) from the Palm-window
  node (`g3TWedgePlainStmt_of_phi`).

Open leaves (owners):
* `G1Z2SideAreaStmt` (G1 side area; G1Side2*/G1Side3* prover),
* `G1SidePushContStmt` (D89 push continuity; G1SSR prover),
* `G1A1b2SideTendstoStmt` (A1b convergence clause; G1A1b prover),
* `G1WedgePalmZoomStmt` (G1 Palm zoom; G1 prover),
* `G3TCurveStmt` (G3 step 5T (G-a); G3T prover; (R-c) `G3TCutToProfRStmt` is proved,
  `g3TCutToProfRStmt_holds`),
